            "detailed_description": "Explore an uncharted land and recover the pieces of a broken amulet. Valzar is a tough arena action platformer with roguelike elements. Randomized levels full of humanlike enemies, grumpy gods, magic fruit, and mistakes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Encounter enemies that vary in intelligence and combat ability. Rivals move like a player and know all player spells.<br></li><li>Explore randomized maps to find treasure, friends, rivals, gods, and bosses.<br></li><li>Loot randomized spells, equipment, and curses.<br></li><li>Worship gods that may not have your best interest in mind—but with favor comes power.<br></li><li>Identify and consume magic fruit and potions to augment your status and remove curses.<br></li><li>Learn by doing. Discover the world's systems for advancement and safe travel.<br></li><li>Difficult and replayable. Your actions matter. Every run is a new adventure with secrets to unlock.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Explore an uncharted land and recover the pieces of a broken amulet. Valzar is a tough arena action platformer with roguelike elements. Randomized levels full of humanlike enemies, grumpy gods, magic fruit, and mistakes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Encounter enemies that vary in intelligence and combat ability. Rivals move like a player and know all player spells.<br></li><li>Explore randomized maps to find treasure, friends, rivals, gods, and bosses.<br></li><li>Loot randomized spells, equipment, and curses.<br></li><li>Worship gods that may not have your best interest in mind—but with favor comes power.<br></li><li>Identify and consume magic fruit and potions to augment your status and remove curses.<br></li><li>Learn by doing. Discover the world's systems for advancement and safe travel.<br></li><li>Difficult and replayable. Your actions matter. Every run is a new adventure with secrets to unlock.</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Explore an uncharted land and recover the pieces of a broken amulet. Valzar is a tough arena action platformer with roguelike elements.",
